			"notes": "AnvilLib 2.0.0 · NeoForge\n\n## What's Changed\n* 🌟 neoforge支持 by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/1\n* 🌟 实现部分方块状态 物品模型 方块模型的DataProvider by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/2\n* 🐛 修复模型生成位置不正确 by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/3\n* 🌟 更新模型生成api by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/4\n* 🐛 修复模型生成位置不正确 by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/5\n* 🐛 删除println by @Gu-ZT in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/6\n* 🐛试图修复CodecUtil.NUMBER_PROVIDER_CODEC解码数据时的异常截断 by @CgAu3 in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/9\n* ⭐将可以推动方块实体迁移到AnvilLib中 by @CgAu3 in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/10\n* Add bloom post-processing and add RenderDoc integration by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/17\n* Implement bloom post-processing effect by @LouisQuepierts in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/20\n* Add annular sector fsh 添加环扇形 fsh by @MercuryGryph in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/19\n* Add sdf2d for gui rendering and mouse collision by @LouisQuepierts in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/21\n* 添加自定义文字渲染模块 module.font by @Gu-ZT in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/22\n* feat(rendering): add compound submit node infrastructure with dirty tracking for bloom by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/23\n* Add space selection and district management features by @Gu-ZT in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/24\n* 注册表更多种类添加 by @baka4n in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/25\n* Add CreativeTabBuilder for custom tabs and update item registration by @Gu-ZT in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/27\n* feat(rendering): 引入缓存型 Block Entity Rendering 管线，支持视锥剔除、半透明排序与 Bloom by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/26\n* 添加了音效注册表，添加了配方注册 by @baka4n in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/28\n* fix(rendering): remove RenderType sort by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/29\n* 修复误删的注册表项 by @baka4n in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/30\n* 使 registrum 中一些参数名可读 by @MercuryGryph in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/32\n* feat(rendering): add GuiRenderHelper#itemWithTransparency, GuiRenderHelper#tessellateBlock by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/33\n* 更多注册表注册 by @baka4n in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/31\n* refactor(rendering)!: migrate GUI coordinate parameters from int to float by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/34\n* fix(rendering): try to fix bloom resize crash by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/38\n* feat(rendering): Add segment and triangles SDF support, and fix SDF graphics issues by @LouisQuepierts in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/39\n* fix(rendering): correct bounds for SdfGraphics render elements by @LouisQuepierts in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/40\n* Add compute pipeline and buffer layout support enhancements by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/41\n* Add glitch effect and clean up code by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/43\n* refactor(rendering): shared parameter by @LouisQuepierts in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/44\n* fox(rendering): prevent index increment in SdfGraphics when using shared parameters by @LouisQuepierts in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/45\n* Integrate Roseau API change detection and CI workflow by @Gu-ZT in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/46\n* Registrum 添加数据组件谓词构建器支持 by @Gu-ZT in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/47\n* font 模块性能与渲染修复 by @Gu-ZT in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/48\n* Add drawAdditionalCallback to StructurePipRenderingState by @ZhuRuoLing in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilLib/pull/50\n\n..."
